1 How to browse the encyclopedia of computer science and engineering

Just input:
>cd E:\HT30
>ogawa
(ogawa.bat is loaded and the browser starts to run)

There are two databases for the encyclopedia.

E:\HT30\OGAWA\NEW    Original demo for HT3.0 (Rubidium version).
C:\TEMP2             Modified for the video take of July 24, 1990.
                     You can delete this directory.

Due to bugs of the current version of HT3.0 (Lanthanum, June 12, 1990
article names are not shown on the upper left corner of the display. 
You can show the article names (after the bugs are fixed) by changing 
*.stl files.

2 Japanese version

Currently two articles, Addressing and Indirect Addressing, have the 
Japanese version. The Japanese articles are refering each other, The 
Japanese article 'Indirect Addressing' splits the window and shows both 
English and Japanese. They are incomplete and intended to just give you 
an image of a bilanguage encyclopedia.
